# Netscape HTTP Cookie File
# https://curl.haxx.se/rfc/cookie_spec.html
#
# Copy this file to cookies.txt (same folder) and fill in your real values.
# NEVER paste these values into chat with the agent — session cookies are live credentials.
#
# For classic on-premise/BTP ABAP Environment via SAP_SESSIONID:
#   Replace <your.domain.com>, <SYS> (system ID, e.g. DS1), <CLI> (client, e.g. 100)
# https://<your.domain.com>	FALSE	/	TRUE	0	SAP_SESSIONID_<SYS>_<CLI>	<YOUR_VALUE>
# https://<your.domain.com>	FALSE	/	TRUE	0	sap-usercontext	<YOUR_VALUE>
#
# For BTP/Cloud systems (*.ondemand.com), use these two cookies instead:
# https://<your.domain>.ondemand.com	FALSE	/	TRUE	0	__VCAP_ID__	<YOUR_VALUE>
# https://<your.domain>.ondemand.com	FALSE	/	TRUE	0	JSESSIONID	<YOUR_VALUE>
